| \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-(4-6) \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, since ${A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{det(A)}{C}^{T},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{21}^{′} & =\\frac{1}{\\text{det}(A)}{c}_{12} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6-k}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{6-k}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since we are told that ${a}_{21}^{′}=\\frac{2}{5}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{6-k} & =\\frac{2}{5} \\\\ 2\\cdot 5 & =2(6-k) \\\\ 10 & =12-2k \\\\ 2k & =2 \\\\ k & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288574 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288575 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288576 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288577 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288578 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1041 "selection" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288575 13194139534443 true] [17592186288573 1110 #uuid "32185872-743f-5625-abaf-14cc3904b386" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288574 1034 "2" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534443 true] [17592186288574 1111 #uuid "b92df9bf-57f8-52c4-bdb1-778f42842a6b" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288575 1034 "1" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534443 true] [17592186288575 1111 #uuid "30d4d4f3-edf3-50e0-b558-676c2c519051" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288576 1034 "4" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534443 true] [17592186288576 1111 #uuid "88d0c1ad-2e69-53e8-b0f1-14231d6b6c48" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288577 1034 "-1" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534443 true] [17592186288577 1111 #uuid "104c5573-009e-55dc-872f-3406140f4ce6" 13194139534443 true] [17592186288578 1034 "-2" 13194139534443 true] [175